#. あ…朝日奈さん。
#. 腐川さんは平気そう？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, Hina. How's Toko doing?"
msgstr ""

#. 相変わらずだよ。一向に出て来る気配もないし、
#. それに、まだジェノサイダーがどうとか…
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Same as before. She won't come out, and she just keeps\n"
"on mumbling something about Genocide Jack."
msgstr ""

#. …だから置いてきちゃった。
msgctxt "0003 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "So I just left her there."
msgstr ""

#. お、置いてきたの…？
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-You...left her?"
msgstr ""

#. 問題だらけで頭がいっぱいだから、
#. ついでに、お腹の中も埋めちゃえーって。
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"My head was all swimmy, and I was getting pretty\n"
"hungry..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、これ食べ終わったら、
#. また戻るから安心して。
msgctxt "0006 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Oh, but don't worry! I'm gonna head back as soon as\n"
"I'm done eating."
msgstr ""

#. 腐川ちゃん、嫌なヤツだけど、
#. 心配は心配だもんね。
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Toko's not exactly pleasant, but I'm still worried\n"
"about her."
msgstr ""

#. ところでさ…何食べてんの？
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Speaking of which, what are you eating?"
msgstr ""

#. ドーナツに決まってるじゃん！！
msgctxt "0009 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "A donut, of course!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>決まってるんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Of course...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 私、ドーナツと宇宙を作ったって点だけは、
#. 神様を認めてるんだよね。
msgctxt "0011 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"There's two things I'm sure God created—outer space,\n"
"and donuts!"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうなんだ…
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Really...?"
msgstr ""

#. 不二咲ちゃんも…もっとドーナツ食べたかったろうな…
#. 無念だろうな…
msgctxt "0013 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I bet Chihiro would've liked to eat more donuts. Maybe\n"
"that was her one big regret..."
msgstr ""

#. あーあ…もっと不二咲ちゃんと
#. 仲良くしてればよかったなぁ…
msgctxt "0014 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Ahh, I should've tried to spend more time with her..."
msgstr ""

#. そう言えば…
#. 不二咲さんって…誰と仲良かったの？
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Come to think of it...who *did* she spend time with?"
msgstr ""

#. なんか…彼女って不思議ちゃんでさ、
#. あんまり女子とは仲良くなかったんだよね。
msgctxt "0016 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Yeah, she was a little bit strange. Didn't really hang\n"
"out with the other girls much..."
msgstr ""

#. なんて言うか…向こうの方から、
#. 私達とは距離を置いているみたいでさ…
msgctxt "0017 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"It was like...like she was trying to keep her distance\n"
"from us."
msgstr ""

#. そう言えば、大神さんも言ってたっけ…
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Actually, Sakura said something similar."
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんや朝日奈さんがトレーニングに誘っても、
#. 不二咲さんは断り続けてたって…
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"She said that even though you and her invited Chihiro\n"
"to exercise with you, she always refused..."
msgstr ""

#. そうなんだよね…しかも私達だけじゃなくて、
#. <CLT 3>女子のみんなと距離を置いてる<CLT>みたいだったよ…
msgctxt "0020 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Yup, it's true. And it wasn't just us, either. It was\n"
"like she <CLT 3>stayed away from all the girls<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 人見知り…だったとか？
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Was she just...shy?"
msgstr ""

#. …でもさ、その割には、
#. <CLT 3>気軽に男子に話し掛けてた<CLT>よ。
msgctxt "0022 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I dunno, she <CLT 3>talked to the boys all the time<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 同性には人見知りで、
#. 異性ならオッケーっておかしくない？
msgctxt "0023 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Isn't it kinda weird to be shy around your own sex,\n"
"but totally fine with the opposite sex?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、待って！　もしかして…！
msgctxt "0024 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Oh, wait! Maybe..."
msgstr ""

#. 男にちやほやされたい…ってタイプだったのかも。
#. 人は見かけによらないっていう法則によればッ！
msgctxt "0025 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Maybe she was used to guys spoiling her. The law says\n"
"you can't judge a book by its cover, right?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの彼女が…？
#. とても、そんなタイプには思えないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You think so? I never really saw her as that kind of\n"
"girl...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>朝日奈の証言<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Aoi's Account<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>始まる…学級裁判が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Begin the class trial, or...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 始まってしまうんだな…
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's about to begin."
msgstr ""

#. あーあ…
#. もっと不二咲ちゃんと仲良くしてればよかったなぁ…
msgctxt "0030 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Ahh, I should've tried to spend more time with her..."
msgstr ""

#. そう言えば…
#. 不二咲さんって…誰と仲良かったの？
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Come to think of it...who *did* she spend time with?"
msgstr ""

#. なんか…彼女って不思議ちゃんでさ、
#. あんまり女子とは仲良くなかったんだよね。
msgctxt "0032 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Yeah, she was a little bit strange. Didn't really hang\n"
"out with the other girls much..."
msgstr ""

#. なんて言うか…向こうの方から
#. 私達とは距離を置いているみたいでさ…
msgctxt "0033 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"It was like...like she was trying to keep her distance\n"
"from us."
msgstr ""

#. そう言えば、大神さんも言ってたっけ…
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Actually, Sakura said something similar."
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんとか朝日奈さんがいくらトレーニングに誘っても、
#. 不二咲さんは断り続けてたって…
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"She said that even though you and her invited Chihiro\n"
"to exercise with you, she always refused..."
msgstr ""

#. そうなんだよね…しかも私達だけじゃなくて、
#. <CLT 3>女子のみんなと距離を置いてる<CLT>みたいだったし…
msgctxt "0036 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Yup, it's true. And it wasn't just us, either. It was\n"
"like she <CLT 3>stayed away from all the girls<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 人見知り…だったとか？
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Was she just...shy?"
msgstr ""

#. …でもさ、その割には<CLT 3>気軽に男子に話し掛けてた<CLT>よ。
msgctxt "0038 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I dunno, she <CLT 3>talked to the boys all the time<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 同性には人見知りで、
#. 異性ならオッケーっておかしくない？
msgctxt "0039 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Isn't it kinda weird to be shy around your own sex,\n"
"but totally fine with the opposite sex?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、待って！　もしかして…！
msgctxt "0040 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Oh, wait! Maybe..."
msgstr ""

#. 男にちやほやされたい…ってタイプだったのかも。
#. 人は見かけによらないっていう法則によればッ！
msgctxt "0041 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Maybe she was used to guys spoiling her. The law says\n"
"you can't judge a book by its cover, right?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの彼女が…？
#. とても、そんなタイプには思えないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You think so? I never really saw her as that kind of\n"
"girl...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学級裁判はいつ始まるんだろう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wonder when the class trial's gonna start...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕は監視カメラで見ていたはずだ。
#. 不二咲さんが殺されたところも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind must have been watching as Chihiro was\n"
"killed...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>黒幕はそれを知った上で…
#. ボクらにこんな事をさせているのか…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They know what's happened, and they're still forcing\n"
"us to go through with this...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ついつい時計を見上げてしまう…
#. 意味ないって知ってるのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I know it's pointless, but I can't stop looking at the\n"
"clock.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時間は流れているはずだけど…
#. ここだけ…取り残されてるようだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Time never stops flowing, but still...here it feels\n"
"like it's been left behind...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0050 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0051 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
